#: ../../Rapid_Mix/RM_Design.rst:99
msgid ""
"The width of the expanded flow, :math:`W_{exp}`, is equal to the large eddy "
"length scale, :math:`L_{eddy}`."
msgstr ""
"El ancho del flujo expandido, :math:`W_{exp}`, es igual a la escala de "
"longitud del remolímen grande, :math:`L_{eddy}`."

